  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">End Child Marriage Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preventing Child Marriage for at least 38,500 adolescent girls, and indirectly many more, in the East and West Gojam Zones of the Amhara Region of Ethiopia while supporting the Government of Ethiopia to develop a sustainable model to end Child Marriage that can be scaled up by government and development partners.</narrative>
  </description>
